# RESQ-OS Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# Copy to .env or configure in Vercel / Netlify / Render project settings.

# Backend API base URL
# Local development: leave unset or empty to use Vite proxy (/api -> http://localhost:8000)
# Production deployment (e.g., Vercel):
# Set to your deployed Render backend URL (with or without /api):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://resq-os.onrender.com
